Description: php.ini-production: session.upload_progress.enabled = Off, a temporary mitigation of CVE-2026-115560 (and CVE-2026-109619) until the next PHP release, as the port; existing php.ini files stay as they are.
Origin: freebsd-ports lang/php83/files/patch-php.ini-production @ eb0100f974b6

--- php.ini-production.orig	2026-10-23 20:33:34 UTC
+++ php.ini-production
@@ -1551,7 +1551,9 @@ session.sid_bits_per_character = 5
 ; Development Value: On
 ; Production Value: On
 ; https://php.net/session.upload-progress.enabled
-;session.upload_progress.enabled = On
+; Temporary mitigation for CVE-2026-115560 / CVE-2026-109619.
